I just surrendered to being apart.

419
00:26:22,232 --> 00:26:26,832
いつもの後悔が風に消えてく
My usual regrets fade away in the wind.

420
00:26:26,832 --> 00:26:32,532
誰にも見せないその姿を
That side of you that you show to no one else,

421
