436
00:28:05,232 --> 00:28:11,032
誰にも見せない僕の姿を
A side of myself that I show to no one,

437
00:28:11,032 --> 00:28:16,532
もうちょっとだけ見せたかったんだ
I just wanted to show you a little longer.

438
00:28:16,532 --> 00:28:24,832
時がそっと睨んでいる
Time is gently glaring at us.

439
00:28:24,832 --> 00:28:30,032
この目と目合わせはっきりしたい
I want to look eye to eye and make things clear.

440
00:28:30,032 --> 00:28:35,032
もうできないのかな
Is that no longer possible?

441
00:28:35,032 --> 00:28:45,832
こんなにもどかしくて辛いのが 音を立てるオーケストラ
This painful frustration making sound is an orchestra.

442
00:28:45,832 --> 00:28:49,832
どこで何をしてるの？
Where and what are you doing?

443
00:28:49,832 --> 00:28:56,832
分からないのは僕のせいなんだね
Not knowing is my fault, isn't it?

444
00:28:56,832 --> 00:29:02,032
永遠にこんな日がくるなんて
That a day like this would come for eternity...

445
00:29:02,032 --> 00:29:10,532
神様イタズラなら呪いたいぐらい
If it's God's prank, I want to curse it.

446
00:29:31,032 --> 00:29:34,832
その手と手繋いで
Holding those hands together,

447
00:29:34,832 --> 00:29:38,832
笑い合った声
the sound of our shared laughter...

448
00:29:38,832 --> 00:29:42,032
忘れはしないよ
I will never forget.

449
00:29:42,032 --> 00:29:52,232
こんなにも流してた涙も 語る声もオーケストラ
All these tears shed and our talking voices form an orchestra.

450
00:29:52,232 --> 00:29:56,832
やがて訪れたよね
It eventually came, didn't it?

451
00:29:56,832 --> 00:30:00,532
さよならの声
The voice saying goodbye.

452
00:30:00,068 --> 00:30:03,268
これを知らないよ
I didn't even know this.

453
00:30:03,268 --> 00:30:05,968
あなたにも近くにいた
I was supposed to be close to you,

454
00:30:05,968 --> 00:30:09,168
はずが今では
but now, connected...

455
00:30:09,168 --> 00:30:12,768
つながりなんて
...by nothing more than...

456
00:30:12,768 --> 00:30:17,668
この空だけ
...this sky.

457
00:30:18,068 --> 00:30:23,068
Wo-oh-oh...
Woah...

458
00:30:25,068 --> 00:30:33,568
Wo-oh-oh...
Woah...

