さよならもう行かなきゃ 何もかも忘れて
Goodbye, I must go now, forgetting everything.

504
00:34:15,568 --> 00:34:27,568
硝子の上を裸足のまま歩く 痛むごとに血が流れて落ちていく
Walking barefoot over the glass, with every step of pain, blood flows and drips down.

